  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TCPF: GAMS - Gum arabic for climate change mitigation and adaptation project preparation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Technical Cooperation Programme (TCPf) would be to help the Sudan Forest National Corporation develop the full project proposal ?Gums for Adaptation and Mitigation in Sudan (GAMS)? for the Green Climate Fund. The TCPf would prepare, and then operate alongside, the Project Preparation Facility (PPF) to be obtained from the Green Climate Fund, and would also constitute FAO?s co-financing for the PPF.</narrative>
  </description>
